#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/architecture.rst:7
#: 20718047ada44b8b8adb642639967443
msgid ""
"ToolUniverse follows a modular, registry-based architecture centered "
"around the unified `ToolUniverse` engine. It connects to massive "
"scientific databases and APIs through tool registration, configuration, "
"and auto-discovery, providing a consistent interface for upper-layer "
"agents, applications, and MCP clients."
msgstr ""
"ToolUniverse 采用以统一的 `ToolUniverse` "
"引擎为核心的模块化、基于注册表的架构。通过工具注册、配置和自动发现，连接海量科学数据库和 API，为上层智能体、应用程序及 MCP "
"客户端提供一致的接口。"

